4n rooli ja selvit\u00e4 ep\u00e4ilytt\u00e4v\u00e4n kahvilan mysteeri. Soluttaudu, etsi todistusaineistoa, \u00e4l\u00e4k\u00e4 miss\u00e4\u00e4n nimess\u00e4 j\u00e4\u00e4 kiinni. \n\nPeli on tehty yhteisty\u00f6ss\u00e4 Metropolian kolmannen vuoden opiskelijoiden ja Ylen kanssa. \n\nLue lis\u00e4\u00e4: \nhttps://yle.fi/aihe/historia/kieltolaki \nhttp://gamesblogs.metropolia.fi/salakapakka/", "short_description": "Astu 1920-luvun Helsinkiin ja k\u00e4y tutkimaan salaper\u00e4ist\u00e4 mysteerikahvilaa."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "3092869367412511", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/11162702_760613700793011_4081331521003192320_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=s3XcAF_7qd4Q7kNvwEfmeGz&_nc_oc=Adr-qv_av3ppcxNsNinO7nWl8wgipzQh_p_Kj5jEXd-ZVbgd8_mhwreXoss1PKMoW_0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af_CineCB6CusK4NjtD9eGnndvCH5IADJhEzWKlLt56m4A&oe=6A26BDD4"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "3052622228115034", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/12386286_555864938090815_4744680728720048128_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=JDMO1-4OmhkQ7kNvwF6yopk&_nc_oc=AdoZRXgeC4hQRWXw849jmC6qsgj-vCRckZ1Itqepfp4XTbkXkqzX3vzHR1LTUfMP0Lw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af8SfSMUdhL-V2N89NFkGHr6u9JNdeqFJE1nlJj5XFmcVA&oe=6A26C2B2"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "635734543935653", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/11162754_583536608704930_1984236639773261824_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=SppajHcd8GgQ7kNvwFB3rT2&_nc_oc=AdqUTnK0fIWtj0NR7yQ-hzj_roOin8Zguam-Uc6pTxCY51h4-sAQToQGKzEZqQ5e8O4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af97pQOQBPju7f3USeGySju5ZYL0Y0oalTnsWeYZy4YWpQ&oe=6A26D055"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.p